{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Touhou fan fiction RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A traditional dungeon strategy RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore each dungeon, defeat the boss, and advance to the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To advance to the next dungeon, you must listen to the stories of the townspeople.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053790/extras/df65eccff6a0d73f81aaa74424aed369.avif?t=1761924996\" width=1276 height=846 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game focuses on the story and features a vast field!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because of the story-focused approach, it's not possible to recruit all characters during the story, but</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clearing the game, you can do a gacha to recruit all characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Afterwards, EX and replays are also possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bThis game is set in a parallel world of Touhou.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marisa was on guard at one of the resistance's bases of operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boring time. Marisa was about to skip her guard duty...but then, an Imperial soldier appeared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On her way back to report, Marisa found a girl lying on the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girl had lost her memory and only remembered her name: Reimu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Imperial soldier's goal was this girl. Marisa decided to join them in order to help her escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fantasy story about taking on the powerful Empire. Beginning!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Strong New Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clearing the game, you can play from the beginning, maintaining your previous state.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4053790?t=1761924996","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053790/6d49bfdbbc779985e25f55fffdb18d6af97b5cf0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761924996","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053790/be6d6270e1aa15035c06e5f38f69bb2ebd6bbaf8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761924996","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053790/be6d6270e1aa15035c06e5f38f69bb2ebd6bbaf8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761924996","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"There is a sex scene with the characters that appear.\r\nAll characters in this game are over the age of 18.\r\nThis game includes sexual acts.\r\nThis game contains female nudity."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Touhou fan fiction RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A traditional dungeon strategy RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore each dungeon, defeat the boss, and advance to the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To advance to the next dungeon, you must listen to the stories of the townspeople.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053790/extras/df65eccff6a0d73f81aaa74424aed369.avif?t=1761924996\" width=1276 height=846 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game focuses on the story and features a vast field!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because of the story-focused approach, it's not possible to recruit all characters during the story, but</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clearing the game, you can do a gacha to recruit all characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Afterwards, EX and replays are also possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bThis game is set in a parallel world of Touhou.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marisa was on guard at one of the resistance's bases of operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boring time. Marisa was about to skip her guard duty...but then, an Imperial soldier appeared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On her way back to report, Marisa found a girl lying on the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girl had lost her memory and only remembered her name: Reimu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Imperial soldier's goal was this girl. Marisa decided to join them in order to help her escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fantasy story about taking on the powerful Empire. Beginning!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Strong New Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clearing the game, you can play from the beginning, maintaining your previous state.</p>","developers":["neronsoft"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053790/87081f7225f03cb508d8cdc65aceb70173ea4b0f/header.jpg?t=1761924996","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4053790/1286628100/18d230df3f976c0c6518cf2c8a02179dc2b542ef/1758532639/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760489365","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4053790/1286628100/18d230df3f976c0c6518cf2c8a02179dc2b542ef/1758532639/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760489365",